    <abstract>
      <para>
        &suse; infrastructure solutions provide validated environments for running traditional and
        cloud-native &sap; workloads on &kvm; virtualization, covering &sap; application servers,
        databases, &hana; and containerized &sap; edge workloads on &rancherprime; and
        &svirtualization;. The result is hardware consolidation, lower costs and near-bare-metal
        performance, with validated support across all layers. Use this guide to confirm whether
        your &sap; deployment falls within supported boundaries and which &sap; notes apply.
      </para>
    </abstract>
